      "description": "Play the classic block puzzle game — reimagined for your Apple Watch!\nFeatures:\n • Built for the wrist: Optimized for Apple Watch with intuitive controls and smooth gameplay.\n • Color combo scoring: Clear blocks of the same color for bonus points!\n • Multi-line clears: Clear 2, 3, or 4 lines at once and rack up combos!\n • Pixel-perfect visuals: Retro-inspired design that looks crisp on the small screen.\n • No ads, no hassle: One-time purchase, no interruptions.\n\nCan you master the game and set new wrist-high scores?",
